_url":"https://qiita.com/Seraimu/items/405864f7ac3c1bc352cb"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1okkL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bbaff1b-54ae-45ec-be88-bb36f28681e6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"お、いけてそう","ts":"1630750694.180600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EiJN7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a43f0517-6b95-4aae-b643-ae4325f13782","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"あ、audioファイルか","ts":"1630750615.180000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=SDY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a87e615d-f87a-4bd5-a445-c36fd4828865","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"これとは違うでしょうか\n```const result = await ky(\"\u003chttps://www.google.com\u003e\").text();\nconsole.log(result);```","ts":"1630750603.179600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3=PrR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cf238c2-55e8-44b2-9432-d09a06eb463b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`await result.arrayBuffer();` でも良さそう","ts":"1630750433.179100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eoPj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1814f63-caa9-46c9-953a-faac78ac7c41","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Blob 型が返ってくるようです。Blob 型は触ったことがないのでこの先は正直お手上げですｗ","ts":"1630750229.178700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tx1MD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e54a6e58-f587-4806-8d53-a029be2dd8d0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`await result.blob();` もいけたと思います。","ts":"1630750149.177700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V2OQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea587a25-7e8f-4786-87e4-5cf8d0bb3cfe","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"で、本来やりたいことは、`audio/wav` なファイルのダウンロードなんですが","ts":"1630750111.177300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/K9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e02c9f1-e295-460f-9ae1-549e2606d9ef","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"逆に勉強になりました。そうか、fetch のレスポンスの `Response` ってストリームで値取れるのか。","ts":"1630750053.176700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HkF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c587433a-3d0c-41e9-83b7-99b43c72e68c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"おぉ、なるほど","ts":"1630750026.176200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j8y2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eabb7649-892b-4043-abf0-50dfdf98a19d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こんな感じで `result.json()` などを await すればとれそうです。","ts":"1630750015.176000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b14e5d0-2ebd-47f3-b85e-f1350c289641","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```import { ky } from \"./deps.ts\";\n\nconst result = await ky.default.get(\"\u003chttps://www.google.com\u003e\");\nconsole.log(await result.{text,json}());```","ts":"1630749999.175600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ll="}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa916306-3197-4bc9-941b-21408f7fb2ec","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Promise\u0026lt;Response\u0026gt; してくれているようなので","ts":"1630749969.175100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tC6E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd818020-987c-4177-9ab8-28b4fb1dae9e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"どうも","ts":"1630749962.174900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/M"}]},{"client_msg_i